# Greek Alphabet
Alpha        Α; alpha        α
Beta         Β; beta         β
Gamma        Γ; gamma        γ
Delta        Δ; delta        δ
Epsilon      Ε; epsilon      ε
Zeta         Ζ; zeta         ζ
Eta          Η; eta          η
Theta        Θ; theta        θ
Iota         Ι; iota         ι
Kappa        Κ; kappa        κ
Lambda Lamda Λ; lambda lamda λ
Mu           Μ; mu           μ
Nu           Ν; nu           ν
Xi           Ξ; xi           ξ
Omicron      Ο; omicron      ο
Pi           Π; pi           π
Rho          Ρ; rho          ρ
Sigma        Σ; sigma        σ; altsigma ς
Tau          Τ; tau          τ
Upsilon      Υ; upsilon      υ
Phi          Φ; phi          φ
Chi          Χ; chi          χ
Psi          Ψ; psi          ψ
Omega        Ω; omega        ω

# Alternate Greek Letters
varbeta       ϐ
vartheta      ϑ
varupsilon    ϒ
varphi        ϕ
varkappa      ϰ
varrho        ϱ
Vartheta      ϴ
varepsilon    ϵ
rvarepsilon ϶

# Infinities
infty, infinity ∞
aleph           ℵ
beth            ℶ

# Imaginary
i        i
j        j
dotlessi 𝚤
dotlessj 𝚥

# Physics
hbar     ℏ

# Other
Thorn Þ; thorn þ
Eth   Ð; eth   ð
